=== SHARED CONTEXT: INTERVIEWIQ AI BACKEND ===

PRODUCT: InterviewIQ AI is a voice-based mock interviewer. The frontend (Next.js, already built) records the candidate's spoken answer in the browser and calls this backend. The backend: converts audio → transcribes it with Gnani Prisma (STT) → evaluates the answer with an LLM against a rubric → decides an adaptive follow-up or next question → speaks it with Gnani Timbre (TTS) → returns everything as JSON. At the end it produces a scored report.

STACK: Python 3.11+, FastAPI, Uvicorn, Pydantic v2, httpx (async), motor (MongoDB) with an in-memory fallback, PyJWT[crypto] (Clerk JWT verification), imageio-ffmpeg (bundled ffmpeg binary, so no system install), anthropic SDK + a generic OpenAI-compatible client, pytest + respx. No Redis, Celery, Docker or agent frameworks.

