   - `async def evaluate_and_plan(session: StoredSession, transcript: str, audio_duration_sec: float) -> TurnOutcome` where TurnOutcome = { evaluation: AnswerEvaluation (overall computed by compute_overall, modelAnswer None), next: NextQuestion|None, isComplete: bool }.
   - Server-side enforcement AFTER the LLM answers (never trust it blindly): max 2 follow-ups per topic (force next_topic if exceeded); `maxQuestions` = {5: 4, 10: 7, 15: 11}; finish when questionsAsked >= maxQuestions OR elapsed time > durationMin*60 + 45 s; when action is next_topic and blueprint topics remain, prefer the blueprint's next openingQuestion but let the LLM's nextQuestion override it only when it is a difficulty-adapted rewrite of the same topic; when blueprint topics are exhausted and questions remain, accept the LLM's new topic; when `finish`, nextQuestion must be null. If the LLM returns an inconsistent decision (e.g. follow_up with null question) fall back to the next blueprint question or finish.
